},{"title":"塞下曲赠翁东厓侍郎总制十八首 其十八","author":"唐顺之","text":"青青塞草羽书稀，士女鼾眠畜牧肥。\n戏看侍儿呈舞马，醉邀幕客对弹棋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28777,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶感十一首 其一","author":"唐顺之","text":"盖屋曾无一把茅，姑苏城外尽荒郊。\n行人欲识邮亭处，问是军烧是贼烧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28778,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶感十一首 其二","author":"唐顺之","text":"贼来窥户正临妆，虏得吴娃似孟姜。\n箫鼓满船催送酒，大王今夜作新郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28779,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶感十一首 其三","author":"唐顺之","text":"毒药本能攻毒病，病瘳药发更堪论。\n借问苗兵谁驾御，远观元季近桃源。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28780,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶感十一首 其四","author":"唐顺之","text":"胜败于今自可明，不调琴瑟也须更。\n满地髑髅多祝发，糿纷犹尚说僧兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28781,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶感十一首 其五","author":"唐顺之","text":"讵道狼兵能贾勇，浑身裹铁怯如何。\n不似江东轻俊子，袒衣黄帽去挥戈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":28782,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶感十一首 其六","author":"唐顺之","text":"袒